                    "q": "What is Makhzanko?",
                    "a": "Makhzanko is a comprehensive cloud platform designed to manage warehouses, sales, accounting, and installments. It providing integrated solutions for SMEs to manage their business from anywhere."
                },
                {
                    "q": "Can I try the system for free?",
                    "a": "Yes, you can start a 14-day free trial with access to all features to evaluate how well the system fits your needs."
                },
                {
                    "q": "Is my data safe with Makhzanko?",
                    "a": "Absolutely. We use advanced encryption protocols (SSL) and perform periodic backups of your data on secured cloud servers to ensure it's never lost."
                },
                {
                    "q": "Does the system support VAT?",
                    "a": "Yes, the system is fully equipped to handle taxes and financial regulations in various countries, with the ability to customize tax invoices."
                },
                {
                    "q": "Can I work via mobile?",
